WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:04.960
The blank answer box is the slowest part of any bid.

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:09.610
Velstrian Bid drafts a first answer from your own documents and past answers.

00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:13.420
It shows which document a point came from, so you can check it.

00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:16.230
You edit, and you keep your own voice.

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:17.600
Velstrian Bid.
